  "answer": "This crash has been reported before. The stack trace is the same: a NullReferenceException in Microsoft.Plugin.Program.Programs.UWPApplication.Launch, thrown when PowerToys Run or the Program plugin launches a UWP/Store app. The maintainers closed the later reports as duplicates of PowerToys#39090 (the original report). The archived tickets give no fix or workaround. Please add your version (0.100.2.0), your Windows build and your bug report ZIP to #39090. Until a fix ships, launching the app another way, such as from the Start menu, avoids the crash. Keep PowerToys updated, because the fix will arrive in a release. One similar report, #47184, was left open for lack of information, so include the log files and the exact app you were launching."
